flowchart TD
    T[Runtime receives entity activation] --> U{Live unit?}
    U -->|No| I[Ignore: no life, charge, state, audio, or animation]
    U -->|Yes, rotate tool| R[Apply rotate action]
    U -->|Yes, normal tap| E[Apply exit action]
    R --> RA{Accepted?}
    RA -->|No| I
    RA -->|Yes| RC[Update puzzle state and charge UI]
    E --> EA{Result}
    EA -->|BLOCKED_PATH| B[Runtime subtracts one life and triggers bump]
    EA -->|Other rejection| I
    EA -->|Accepted| X[Commit escaped unit + switches + gates atomically]
    X --> W{Puzzle complete?}
    W -->|No| C[Play escape feedback]
    W -->|Yes| S[Calculate stars, persist progress, play win once]
